MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Holiday Wishes felt like a natural choice because several of my past interactions were with Christmas albums.",
    "The Christmas Song also connected clearly with that holiday interest, although I would only try Holiday Wishes on this visit."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Greatest Hits and 21 Number Ones gave me no identified artist or clear connection to my listening, so I had little reason to try them.",
    "The soundtrack and named artists' collections did not give me the Christmas connection that made the holiday albums appealing."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The selections seemed to assume that an interest in a few albums would extend to a broad range of music collections.",
    "A greatest-hits or best-of collection is not appealing to me just because I have listened to an album called The Classic Christmas Album."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The explicit Christmas theme across several past interactions mattered more to my choices here than a general connection to music.",
    "My holiday interactions were clustered in November 2014, while my latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned in September 2016; I would not treat the older cluster as proof that I only want Christmas music now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The holiday suggestions gave me a clear reason to choose, but most other selections stretched my listening history into interests I had not expressed."
}
